  "source_pdf": "downloads/pigsys-boing-boing-band-v1.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "752b6da5dd7cadc41da490df0ae05893ef7c7ab834e5599a15edb4db8eb198e1",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47b3eee565ab317233ca01f40b25811802b2fe99a5622276ed0e470df1d7aff5",
      "text": "Pigsy’s\nBoing-Boing Band",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "282625e5e6c07c053662697f2fbe510c6a55983c2598e4ab6bdd11e9c19d1b4e",
      "text": "Pigsy makes a frog from a\nbig box.\nIt has a big, round belly.\n“Every frog needs a boing!”\nsays Pigsy.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6f4b30c18ed30401fa5d63a61c9a3f7c3ca044742b453e32942f907616d669ad",
      "text": "Sandy helps.\nHe stretches two wide rubber\nbands across the frog’s mouth.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d2990cb3c14f88c1fb63f5b51ca6eeb5d93827afb48cd643d30e9572bd9ad03c",
      "text": "Wukong plucks one band.\nBoing! The frog hums.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f0ae660e42f268303452e4d2a4d71241d4fb2bf2645691e0e5a4fa3d159ce441",
      "text": "He presses the band to\npluck again.\nThe sound stops!\n“Froggy, why did you stop?”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "94a75e2d30df2c86219030e111bf1d828d37a6a6887aa33fd55618aa8a50237c",
      "text": "Pigsy pats the frog.\n“Are you sleepy, Froggy?”\nThe frog says nothing.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "428d6f5d5577aa142b48a6a94358c3f0f002440d2da66a177c981ed7d3a549cd",
      "text": "Nezha has an idea.\n“Let’s watch and listen.\nPluck it again, and look at\nthe band.”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d7a5712f343989e6a3c211092849a1457c828f986b2b78b85d7af5fca82cad4b",
      "text": "Boing! The band shakes so\nfast, it looks blurry.\n“It vibrates,” says Nezha.\n“That makes the sound.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "54eb2b900bba7f502fb02f14293975e232a7efab066eb65aed05fa8466d5cf39",
      "text": "Wukong presses the band.\nIt stops vibrating.\nThe sound stops too.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5dc9c1cf50417121b51cc506d5e955df98b282718fc325f6163c930875dfb2ac",
      "text": "Pigsy plucks and touches\nthe box.\nBuzz! He can feel it shake.\n“It tickles!” says Pigsy.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "63a2428769a02860c88bf10d86591cd5fb9451b031c29dab82cb037b2ccc26bb",
      "text": "Now they pluck both bands.\nBoing! Boing!\nWukong holds one band still.\nOnly one sound is left.\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "98577516edeb48e91a24296ba8692cab69d41ab75b715e334e8af3909347ef64",
      "text": "“Shaking band, boing!”\nsays Wukong.\n“Still band, quiet!”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4cadc75da0866484c368a8214e145b2b79ad23532bc5435fcac41b5d49f3463f",
      "text": "Pigsy wants a big,\nloud concert.\nHe reaches to pull the band\nway back.\n“Gentle plucks,” says Sandy.\n“The frog likes soft songs.”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1355c88054b3967f1179c4d693830d41a2d5a9cfe237b655a242f2ffdcac6554",
      "text": "Pigsy plucks one band.\nNezha plucks the other.\nWhen Wukong says “Stop!”,\nthey hold the bands still.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "13ac4eb269d48ede95f0414ee3a6b25d09f138cd4319b3c47fb65bedc73d948f",
      "text": "Boing, boing… stop!\nBoing… stop!\nIt is a quiet little song.\nSandy claps softly.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a38c2f946bd9c656117b0c4d0feed54033693374fb12056c78a076f9becb0eb6",
      "text": "Pigsy bows to the frog.\nGrumble! goes his tummy.\n“A new sound!” says Wukong.\n“Snack time!” says Pigsy.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
